  <!-- nav items based on user.role -->
</nav>
```

For route access control, use a `CanActivate` guard that reads the same service. `providedIn: 'root'` makes it a singleton, so nothing resets on navigation. If you want the login to survive a page refresh, persist the user to `localStorage` in the service.

